From a1c8b782beece4a1cec3d65c12bb930a20f02f8c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sylwester Lachiewicz <slachiewicz@apache.org>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:17:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] THRIFT-6213: Define the TConfiguration default constants in
 the library Client: cpp

An odr-used static const data member needs this out-of-line definition in
every C++ standard; drop it only once the constants become inline
constexpr.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
